<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sistem Verifikasi Ijazah Digital - USK</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4">

    <div class="w-full max-w-3xl bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200">
        
        <div class="relative bg-[#004799] text-white p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[#004799] font-bold text-xs text-center p-1 shadow-md">
                    LOGO USK
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black tracking-wide leading-tight">UNIVERSITAS SYIAH KUALA</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs tracking-wider opacity-90">DARUSSALAM, BANDA ACEH</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center md:text-right md:border-l md:border-blue-400 md:pl-6">
                <h2 class="text-md md:text-lg font-bold tracking-wide">SISTEM VERIFIKASI IJAZAH DIGITAL</h2>
                <p class="text-xs opacity-75 mt-0.5">USK - Sistem Verifikasi Ijazah Secara Elektronik</p>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-1/3 h-1 bg-amber-400"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 space-y-6">

            <div class="border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4 shadow-sm">
                <div class="bg-green-600 text-white rounded-full w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0 shadow-md">
                    <i class="fas fa-check"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-green-700 text-xl font-black tracking-wide">DOKUMEN ASLI / VERIFIED</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Data ini menyatakan bahwa ijazah dengan nomor tersebut di bawah ini adalah sah dan diterbitkan oleh <strong class="text-gray-800">Universitas Syiah Kuala.</strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#004799] mb-3">
                    <span class="bg-[#004799] text-white w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i></span>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">Detail Data Lulusan</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden divide-y divide-gray-200 text-sm">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 bg-white">
                        <div class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-600 bg-gray-50/50 border-r border-gray-200">Nama Lengkap</div>
                        <div class="p-3 col-span-2 font-bold text-gray-800 uppercase"><%= dataLulusan.namaLengkap %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 bg-white">
                        <div class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-600 bg-gray-50/50 border-r border-gray-200">Nomor Induk Mahasiswa</div>
                        <div class="p-3 col-span-2 text-gray-800"><%= dataLulusan.nim %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 bg-white">
                        <div class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-600 bg-gray-50/50 border-r border-gray-200">Nomor Ijazah Nasional</div>
                        <div class="p-3 col-span-2 font-mono tracking-wide text-gray-800"><%= dataLulusan.nomorIjazah %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 bg-white">
                        <div class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-600 bg-gray-50/50 border-r border-gray-200">Program Studi / Jenjang</div>
                        <div class="p-3 col-span-2 text-gray-800"><%= dataLulusan.programStudi %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 bg-white">
                        <div class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-600 bg-gray-50/50 border-r border-gray-200">Tanggal Kelulusan</div>
                        <div class="p-3 col-span-2 text-gray-800"><%= dataLulusan.tanggalKelulusan %></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-2.5 text-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#004799] mb-1">
                        <span class="bg-[#004799] text-white w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i></span>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">Informasi Dokumen</h4>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3">
                        <span class="text-gray-500">Tanggal Terbit</span>
                        <span class="col-span-2 text-gray-800">: <%= informasiDokumen.tanggalTerbit %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3">
                        <span class="text-gray-500">Perguruan Tinggi</span>
                        <span class="col-span-2 text-gray-800">: <%= informasiDokumen.perguruanTinggi %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3">
                        <span class="text-gray-500">Fakultas</span>
                        <span class="col-span-2 text-gray-800">: <%= informasiDokumen.fakultas %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3">
                        <span class="text-gray-500">Jenis Ijazah</span>
                        <span class="col-span-2 text-gray-800">: <%= informasiDokumen.jenisIjazah %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 items-center">
                        <span class="text-gray-500">Status Verifikasi</span>
                        <span class="col-span-2 text-green-600 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            : <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-sm"></i> <%= informasiDokumen.statusVerifikasi %>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center opacity-20 transform scale-110">
                    <div class="w-28 h-28 border-4 border-amber-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 font-bold text-xs text-center p-2">
                        WATERMARK LOGO
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="bg-green-700 text-white rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                        <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[#004799] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Status Tanda Tangan Elektronik (TTE)
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="text-green-600 font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Tanda Tangan Elektronik Valid</h5>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-0.5 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
                            Dokumen ini telah ditandatangani secara elektronik dengan sertifikat yang diterbitkan oleh <strong>BSrE (Badan Siber dan Sandi Negara).</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-blue-900 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 w-full sm:w-auto shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-amber-400 font-black tracking-widest border-b border-blue-700 pb-0.5 mb-1">BSrE</div>
                    <div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-80">Tersertifikasi Elektronik</div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#004799] text-white px-6 py-4 text-xs flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 border-t border-blue-800">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-amber-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[#004799] font-bold text-[8px] p-0.5">USK</div>
                <div>
                    <p class="font-bold tracking-wide">INOVASI, KOLABORASI, DAN AKUNTABILITAS</p>
                    <p class="opacity-75 text-[10px]">UNTUK USK MAJU DAN BERDAMPAK</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 opacity-80">
                <a href="#" class="hover:underline"><i class="fas fa-globe mr-1"></i> www.usk.ac.id</a>
                <a href="#" class="hover:underline"><i class="fab fa-instagram mr-1"></i> @universitassyiahkuala</a>
            </div>
            <div class="opacity-60 text-center md:text-right">
                &copy; 2026 Universitas Syiah Kuala
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

